---
title: Audio Intelligence Pipeline - Sequence
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor OP as Operator
    participant REC as ADLS recordings
    participant EG as Event Grid
    participant BT as recording_uploaded<br/>blob trigger
    participant DC as Durable client
    participant OR as audio_orchestrator
    participant AC as Activities
    participant SV as PipelineServices
    participant SP as Azure AI Speech
    participant AO as Azure OpenAI
    participant RES as ADLS results

    OP->>REC: upload call recording
    REC-->>EG: BlobCreated
    EG->>BT: InputStream + blob.properties.etag

    BT->>BT: recording_id = sha256("name:etag")[:32]
    BT->>BT: build RecordingMessage<br/>container, blob_name, etag, locale
    BT->>DC: get_status("audio-" + recording_id)

    alt instance running or pending
        DC-->>BT: RUNNING / PENDING
        Note over BT: skip, another orchestration owns this blob
    else no instance, or COMPLETED / FAILED / TERMINATED
        DC-->>BT: None or terminal status
        BT->>OR: start_new("audio_orchestrator", instance_id, message)

        OR->>AC: call_activity result_exists
        AC->>SV: result_exists(RecordingMessage)
        SV->>RES: exists("classified/<id>.json") + get_blob_properties
        RES-->>SV: metadata.source_etag
        SV-->>OR: true / false

        alt already processed, same source etag
            OR-->>DC: {status: already_processed}
        else new or changed recording
            OR->>AC: call_activity transcribe_recording
            AC->>SV: transcribe(RecordingMessage)
            SV->>REC: download_blob().readall()
            REC-->>SV: audio bytes
            SV->>SV: guard empty audio and 250 MB limit

            loop up to 6 attempts, exponential backoff capped at 30s
                SV->>SP: POST /speechtotext/transcriptions:transcribe<br/>multipart audio + definition JSON
                alt 429 or 5xx
                    SP-->>SV: throttled / transient error + retry-after
                else success
                    SP-->>SV: combinedPhrases + durationMilliseconds
                end
            end
            SV-->>OR: TranscriptDocument

            OR->>AC: call_activity classify_transcript
            AC->>SV: classify(TranscriptDocument)
            SV->>AO: beta.chat.completions.parse<br/>model=AZURE_OPENAI_DEPLOYMENT<br/>response_format=ClassificationDocument
            AO-->>SV: parsed ClassificationDocument
            SV->>SV: reject refusal, unparsed, or category<br/>outside CLASSIFICATION_CATEGORIES
            SV-->>OR: ClassificationDocument

            OR->>AC: call_activity store_result
            AC->>SV: save_result(ResultDocument)
            SV->>RES: upload_blob overwrite=true<br/>metadata source_etag, application/json
            RES-->>SV: blob url
            SV-->>OR: result_url
            OR-->>DC: {status: completed, recording_id, result_url}
        end
    end

    Note over RES: ADF / Databricks read results/classified<br/>merge on recording_id, change token = etag
